'''Ranzar Malk's crew'''<ref name="Burg">{{SWCT|set=2021 Base|cardname=Burg}}</ref> was a gang<ref name="Mayfeld" /> of [[Mercenary|mercenaries]] led by ex-[[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Sniper|sharpshooter]] [[Migs Mayfeld]] in order to [[Bothan-Five incident|rescue]] the [[Twi'lek]] [[Qin]] from the ''[[Bothan-5]]'', a [[New Republic Correctional Transport]],<ref name="Chapter 6" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date" /> Although they were able to recover Qin, the crew betrayed one of their own, the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Din Djarin]]. Djarin, however, was able to lock Mayfeld, [[Burg]] and Qin's sister, [[Xi'an]], in a prison cell and destroy the [[droid]] [[Q9-0]], taking Qin back to his client [[Ranzar Malk]].<ref name="Chapter 6" />

